error[E0277]: `?` couldn't convert the error to `pert_ui::AppError`
 --> ui/m04_apperror_question_mark.rs:3:84
  |
3 | fn load() -> Result<String, AppError> { Ok(std::fs::read_to_string("settings.toml")?) }
  |              ------------------------      ----------------------------------------^ the trait `From<std::io::Error>` is not implemented for `pert_ui::AppError`
  |              |                             |
  |              |                             this can't be annotated with `?` because it has type `Result<_, std::io::Error>`
  |              expected `pert_ui::AppError` because of this
  |
  = note: the question mark operation (`?`) implicitly performs a conversion on the error value using the `From` trait
